    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Please note that this game is currently in development and everything is a work in progress. If there's something you don't like, chances are it is being actively worked on!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cybercafe is an idle multiplayer game. Kick back, relax, and grab a coffee with anyone around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local voice and text chat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put in your headphones and listen to songs on your own, or enjoy music with your server as you unwind together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share a moment with your friends or someone new online while grabbing some coffee, tea, and your favorite snack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play games with friends! Board games and various social games such as trivia.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quietly study with company, or review notes and flashcards together. It's up to you how much you want to interact or not.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be courageous and meet new people with the <strong>Match</strong>making system!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up over time and unlock new outfits, accessories and music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the built in calendar and todo lists to keep you and your friends accountable, together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your cafe, and share it with others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Please note that this game is currently in development and everything is a work in progress. If there's something you don't like, chances are it is being actively worked on!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cybercafe is an idle multiplayer game. Kick back, relax, and grab a coffee with anyone around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local voice and text chat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put in your headphones and listen to songs on your own, or enjoy music with your server as you unwind together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share a moment with your friends or someone new online while grabbing some coffee, tea, and your favorite snack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play games with friends! Board games and various social games such as trivia.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quietly study with company, or review notes and flashcards together. It's up to you how much you want to interact or not.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be courageous and meet new people with the <strong>Match</strong>making system!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up over time and unlock new outfits, accessories and music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the built in calendar and todo lists to keep you and your friends accountable, together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your cafe, and share it with others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "An idle multiplayer cafe. Sip coffee with anyone around the world. Study and listen to music with friends, partake in cafe activities, or simply do nothing at all.",
